    "question": "For a material with Young's modulus $Y = 1.8 \\times 10^{11}\\text{ N/m}^2$ and Bulk modulus $K = 1.5 \\times 10^{11}\\text{ N/m}^2$, find its modulus of rigidity $\\eta$.",
